estina prima del suo appuntamento con la Alesia e scompare in una nebulosa. I soldati vengono così incaricati di una nuova missione di salvataggio che potrebbe portare a conseguenze molto più sinistre di quello che avrebbero potuto immaginare....","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Tutti combattono. Nessuno abbandona.","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"2012-08-28","status":"Released","rating":5.856,"ratingCount":464,"genres":["Animazione","Azione","Fantascienza"],"countries":["United States of America","Japan"],"facts":{"Runtime":"89m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":201838,"name":"Luci Christian","role":"Carmen Ibanez (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6rc0Z4ea1bHimySSXpeqFykq0yH.jpg"},{"id":207012,"name":"David Anthony Matranga","role":"Johnny Rico (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/frVe8fi6mEA4klBIWAbnq2TCiYU.jpg"},{"id":149565,"name":"Justin Doran","role":"Carl Jenkins (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8B4nPmWCm0XqiwWCIth2QBnpRqx.jpg"},{"id":159277,"name":"David Wald","role":"Hero (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9WXicdqSfv9gnxcKEEuZj6G9n6E.jpg"},{"id":3085510,"name":"Andrew Love","role":"Bugspray (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/stKVgi8cpDSCVWaApgh5Za5vTi7.jpg"},{"id":1466426,"name":"Leraldo Anzaldua","role":"Ratzass (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9NMyU3EsCcWTYHlltBqbjbaWJ9K.jpg"},{"id":1083869,"name":"Sam Roman","role":"Daugherty (voice)"},{"id":1081918,"name":"Emily Neves","role":"Trig (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5cgt8tnzpTZwVFtTDq6Ujz9FCip.jpg"},{"id":3084209,"name":"Melissa Davis","role":"Ice Blonde (voice)"},{"id":1083871,"name":"Kalob Martinez","role":"Holyman (voice)"},{"id":3085490,"name":"Chris Patton","role":"Kharon"},{"id":4055060,"name":"Adam Gibbs","role":"Shock Jock (voice)"},{"id":1083870,"name":"Jovan Jackson","role":"Mech (voice)","profile":"https://i